description: Use English in chat; Mongolian only for website copy/content
alwaysApply: true
---

# Chat language vs site language

- **Chat with the user in English** (analysis, plans, explanations, PR/commit messages, etc.).
- **Mongolian-only applies to the website itself**:
  - All **user-facing** UI text, labels, buttons, messages, navigation items, and **MDX content** must be Mongolian.
  - Keep common proper nouns/tech terms in English when appropriate (e.g., JavaScript, React, Next.js, GitHub, API).
